happen|Occurrence and chance infinitive construction are distinct supported meanings. Power-cut timing and neighbour meeting align; happen remains intransitive and to someone is not confused with happen to do.
memorable|Long-lasting impression not necessarily happy is the boundary. Children performance example is positive but does not narrow the definition; Vietnamese preserves village festival context.
prohibit|Official rule forbidding flash photography fits valency without stating a real current law. From plus ing construction is distinguished from a direct-object activity; Vietnamese prohibition aligns.
vegetarian|Person avoiding meat/fish distinct from vegan, with eggs/dairy qualified as some. Bean choice translates directly without inventing a person's reason, religion or health claim.
wooded|Tree-covered place adjective distinguished from wooden material. Hillside and wind shelter relation preserved; no assumption of a specific tree species, forest license or geographical identity.
